        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Each institution - Eastern Oregon Correctional Institution (EOCI), Oregon Women's Correctional Center (OWCC), Santiam Correctional Institution (SCI), Shutter Creek Correctional Institution (SCCI), Snake River Correctional Institution (SRCI), Columbia River Correctional Institution (CRCI), Powder River Correctional Facility (PRCF), Oregon Corrections Intake Center (OCIC), Coffee Creek Correctional Facility, Transportation East and Transportation West and Two Rivers Correctional Institution (TRCI).",
